<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib"
                 xmlns:core="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Core;assembly=OpenRigs.Core"
                 xmlns:orcl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Control;assembly=OpenRigs.Control"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The rig's Ready gate, once per workflow, before every device: declares HarpClockSet (the first Harp time within 2 s of UTC, which the workflow's clock sends and every Harp device's log waits for) and ReadyStages, the ReplaySubject each device piece announces its stage into (OpenRigs.Core AnnounceStage, which never completes it), reports Ready to the controller (OpenRigs.Control ReportPhase) once every stage PieceStages and WorkflowStages name has come, and then publishes Ready, the AsyncSubject a task waits on. PieceStages is the pieces' stages; WorkflowStages the workflow's own, each announced by the workflow itself (AnnounceStage into ReadyStages), empty for most. Stops the workflow, naming the stages that never came, if that takes longer than 180 s from Start (the lick spout stage homes its five motors together, each within 60 s).</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:ReplaySubject" TypeArguments="sys:String">
        <rx:Name>ReadyStages</rx:Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Double">
        <rx:Name>HarpClockSet</rx:Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>ReadyStages</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="PieceStages" Description="The stages Ready waits for, comma separated: every stage the workflow's pieces announce, such as HarpClockSet, SpoutsHomed, MixerStarted, Camera-Face." />
        <Property Name="WorkflowStages" Description="The workflow's own stages Ready also waits for, comma separated, each announced by the workflow itself (AnnounceStage into ReadyStages), such as CalibrationReady. Empty for a workflow whose Ready waits only for its pieces." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="core:StartupWatchdog">
          <core:PieceStages />
          <core:WorkflowStages />
          <core:TimeoutSeconds>180</core:TimeoutSeconds>
          <core:What>Readying the rig (the stages ReadyGate's PieceStages and WorkflowStages name)</core:What>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportPhase">
          <orcl:Phase>Ready</orcl:Phase>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
        <Name>Ready</Name>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="2" To="4" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
